  "overview": "Superbikes, Heavy Metal and a Baseball Bat What Else Do You Need?\n\nIt's not a game, it's a way of life. Road Rash for the Sega Saturn system mashes no-holds-barred motorcycle combat racing and the hottest alternative bands to deliver the hardest-hitting action around. You've got only one objective - win at all costs. Lucky for you there are only 3 options - lead, follow, or become road-kill."
